    slug: 'field-to-barrel-heirloom-bloody-butcher-corn',
    title: 'Field to Barrel – Heirloom Bloody Butcher Corn',
    date: '2021-11-23',
    section: 'Distillery',
    tags: ['Bloody Butcher Corn', 'Farm to Bottle Bourbon', 'Flying Ace Farm Distillery', 'White Dog'],
    excerpt: 'The fields at Flying Ace Farm continue to produce! This month, we had our third harvest of 65 acres of Bloody Butcher Virginia heirloom corn.',
